# Repos a reviewer of THIS repo may search and cite, materialized under
# .siblings/<owner>/<repo>. Declared rather than left to the fallback so the
# set is the one this repo actually depends on.
#
# One per line. The reviewer host must also carry a SOURCE_PATHS entry for
# each, or the sibling reports as `missing` and is never searched.
#
# Each row is a real edge: `plow-hermes-agent` is the base this image builds
# FROM by tag and digest, and it owns boot, the hardened home, and the
# compose step that turns `runtime/persona.md` into SOUL.md; `hermes-plugin-plow`
# is the plugin that base pins, which frames every turn and owns the Plow
# tools these skills call; `plow` owns the API and Latch surface behind those
# tools and pins which base tag tenants boot; `agent-index-client` is the
# upstream this repo pins by commit and sha256 in `vendor/client.pin` and runs
# as the `agent-index` service; `plow-agents` is the official runner
# `docs/INSTALL.md` clones into `tools/`, and that `bin/plow-agents` delegates
# account, login, mint and revoke to. `NousResearch/hermes-agent` stays out — it
# reaches this repo only through the base, never read as source here. Peer
# agent variants share no edge with this repo, so they are not listed.

plow-pbc/plow-hermes-agent
plow-pbc/hermes-plugin-plow
plow-pbc/plow
plow-pbc/agent-index-client
plow-pbc/plow-agents
